What this covers
----------------

The antibody characterisation data published by Only Good Antibodies, wherever
you obtain it — through the data portal, the public API, the browser extension,
the MCP server, or the following files in this repository:

    core/data/citeab_papers_2026_05.json      citation index
    browser-extension/data/index.json         published dataset the extension ships
    browser-extension/data/aliases.json       gene alias table
    pipeline/data/antibody_availability_*.csv supplier availability verdicts
    pipeline/data/horizon_hap1_ko.csv         Horizon's public catalogue

Everything else in this repository is code, and is covered by LICENSE.

Two things this repository does *not* contain, so that nobody goes looking:
the full internal characterisation database, and the figure images. The
dataset is served from the site and its API; the images are served from object
storage. See the data access page for how to reach both.


